# Clears spam off channels that don't contain "spam" in their name. Times users out incrementally as they spam more.

in channel not containing "spam"
sends anything
sends the same
sends the same
sends the same
delete last 3 messages
timeout for 5 seconds and warn "yes, we get it... stop it..."
sends anything
sends anything
sends the same
delete last 3 messages and timeout incremental

in channel not containing "spam"
sends anything
less than 1 second later; sends anything
less than 1 second later; sends anything
less than 1 second later; sends anything
less than 1 second later; sends anything
timeout incremental and delete last 5 messages
warn "you're flooding the chat :("
